WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.200
From idea to merged pull request.
How an issue moves through Gitoodo.

2
00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:10.400
Talk through what you want to build in the orchestrator chat.
Gitoodo proposes the issues. Nothing is created until you click Apply.

3
00:00:10.400 --> 00:00:15.400
Once an issue is clear, it moves to Ready.
“All repos” shows each issue’s state and the reason.

4
00:00:15.400 --> 00:00:20.600
An agent starts on every ready issue.
From In progress to In review, you see every step.

5
00:00:20.600 --> 00:00:25.400
When a decision is missing, the agent asks you.
The recommendation is already selected.

6
00:00:25.400 --> 00:00:30.400
One click, and the agent carries on.
Your answer lands in the issue as a comment.

7
00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:35.000
The overview shows your week in numbers.
Merges, answers, worker use. What waits for you is under “Asked of me”.

8
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:38.400
Gitoodo
Free · Open source · macOS and Windows
